  "description": "If your character dies, so do you.\n\n\"Running Family\" is a game where you get to pick the characters to run along different stages. The catch is that the characters in the game are actual people. When a character dies, they disappear from reality as well. Meanwhile, a strange hole appears. Although it swallows certain people, it is invisible to others. How could this mysterious hole be linked to the game? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
